asc-comm development patch package

  --full                          Install or update all packaged Hcomm headers
  --uninstall                     Restore first-install originals and remove new files
  --check                         Verify the archive and payload without modifying CANN
  --install-path=<CANN_ROOT>       Select the CANN root; default: ASCEND_HOME_PATH
  --force                         Override version or installed-file consistency checks

Hcomm AICore headers are installed under asc/include/adv_api/hcomm/ and
asc/impl/adv_api/detail/hcomm/. Header-only Host APIs are installed under
include/hcomm/ through CANN's architecture links.
Existing files are backed up under var/asc-comm-dev-patch/baseline/. This
package is intended only for local development verification. Recompile the
target Ascend C kernel after installation. Only paths present in the package
manifest are managed; this is not a full directory mirror. --force does not
override architecture or payload checksum checks.
